{
  "_comment": "WhatsApp Flow — set up a class for attendance. Rebuilt from scratch; the previous version made a teacher add ONE student per screen round-trip, so a 40-student class was 40 submissions to Meta and nobody ever finished one.",
  "_instructions": [
    "1. Registered automatically by `npm run setup:flows` (flow-configs.js → 'Attendance Setup').",
    "2. The resulting Flow ID is written to ATTENDANCE_SETUP_FLOW_ID in your .env.",
    "3. Endpoint (data_api_version 3.0, encrypted): POST /api/flows/attendance-setup.",
    "4. The grade list is populated dynamically by the endpoint's INIT from GRADES_DROPDOWN (shared/config/registration-data.js), pre-filtered to the grades this teacher recorded at registration."
  ],
  "_notes": [
    "CLASS screen: grade is a Dropdown, never free text — 'Grade 5' / '5th' / 'V' typed freely used to create three different classes.",
    "Section is optional and its label does NOT say so: WhatsApp appends its own '(Optional)' marker, and saying it twice is what shipped before.",
    "ROSTER screen: ONE TextArea for the whole class list, one name per line. The endpoint splits, trims, strips leading numbering/bullets, drops blanks and de-dupes. This is the whole point of the rebuild.",
    "REVIEW screen shows the parsed count back before anything is written, because a paste is easy to get wrong and a silent 63-student class is worse than a visible one."
  ],
  "version": "6.3",
  "data_api_version": "3.0",
  "routing_model": {
    "CLASS": [
      "ROSTER"
    ],
    "ROSTER": [
      "REVIEW"
    ],
    "REVIEW": [
      "SUCCESS"
    ],
    "SUCCESS": []
  },
  "screens": [
    {
      "id": "CLASS",
      "title": "Set up a class",
      "data": {
        "grades": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "grade_3",
              "title": "Grade 3"
            },
            {
              "id": "grade_5",
              "title": "Grade 5"
            }
          ]
        },
        "grade_hint": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "You told us you teach Grade 3 and Grade 5."
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "class_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "Which class is this?"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.grade_hint}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Dropdown",
                "name": "grade",
                "label": "Class",
                "required": true,
                "data-source": "${data.grades}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextInput",
                "name": "section",
                "label": "Section",
                "required": false,
                "input-type": "text",
                "helper-text": "Only if your school splits this class into sections"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Next — add students",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "CLASS",
                    "grade": "${form.grade}",
                    "section": "${form.section}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ROSTER",
      "title": "Add students",
      "refresh_on_back": true,
      "data": {
        "class_display": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Grade 5 - A"
        },
        "existing_note": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Paste or type the whole list — one name per line."
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "roster_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "Add your students"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.class_display}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextCaption",
                "text": "${data.existing_note}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextArea",
                "name": "roster",
                "label": "Student names",
                "required": true,
                "helper-text": "One name per line. Numbers and bullets are cleaned up for you."
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Check the list",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "ROSTER",
                    "roster": "${form.roster}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "REVIEW",
      "title": "Check the list",
      "data": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "28 students in Grade 5 - A"
        },
        "preview": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "1. Ayesha Bibi\n2. Ahmed Raza\n3. Fatima Noor"
        },
        "warning": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": ""
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "review_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.preview}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextCaption",
                "text": "${data.warning}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Save this class",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "REVIEW",
                    "confirm": "save"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SUCCESS",
      "title": "Class saved",
      "terminal": true,
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Grade 5 - A is ready"
        },
        "preview": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "28 students saved. Say \"attendance\" whenever you want to mark them."
        },
        "warning": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": ""
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "done_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.preview}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextCaption",
                "text": "${data.warning}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Done",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "complete",
                  "payload": {}
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
